Using S30_PLUGIN_EXTENSION for new pattern plugins/configs and S60_EVALUATION_QC to confirm NN stats are already part of QC.

Added point-process pattern plugins for inhom Poisson and Thomas cluster as thin wrappers to existing generators, plus a new Strauss-style repulsive generator that enforces a minimum distance with a grid-accelerated rejection loop and a max-attempts safety cap. Added Hydra pattern configs for the three new plugins and expanded pattern tests to cover determinism, min-distance enforcement, and a simple NN-distance contrast between cluster and repulsive (QC already outputs `spatial.nn_stats`, so no QC code changes were needed).

